+01 ROUTE-TYPE                     PIC X(16).
+01 OUTPUT-CODE                    PIC X(32).
+01 FIELD-COUNT                    PIC 9 VALUE 0.
+01 VALID-INPUT                    PIC X VALUE "Y".
+
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN.
     ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
+    PERFORM PARSE-INPUT
+    PERFORM VALIDATE-INPUT
+    PERFORM CHECK-ELIGIBILITY
+    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(OUTPUT-CODE)
